The  driver  provides  support  for  Prolific PL2301/PL2302 based
host‐to‐host USB connectors.  The driver appears as  a  point‐to‐
point network interface and should be configured with in the same
way as other point‐to‐point interfaces.  The device supports IPv4
only.   The  driver supports the following adapters from the fol‐
lowing vendors: Belkin, Entrega, and Xircom do use this chip  and
